---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Thoughts - Aatu Alatalo" lang="en" activeNav="about" translationUrl="/about">
  <div class="content-wrapper">
    <div class="philosophy-container">
      <h1 class="philosophy-title">Thoughts</h1>
      <div class="philosophy-text">
        <p>This is a placeholder for your philosophy, thoughts, and the deeper meaning behind your photography. The text is set in a narrow column to ensure a calm reading experience, reminiscent of a fine-art book layout.</p>
        <p>Photography, for me, is not merely about recording fleeting moments. It is a way of looking at the world, forcing oneself to pause, and understanding the subtle dialogue between light and shadow in our environment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
